  "note": "These are the levels the route produces, not a training plan: Defence stays at 1 until Dragon Slayer I, and only the training steps name a target (Attack 30/40, Strength 20, Magic 25, Mining 10, Woodcutting 36, Ranged 30, Prayer 43...). Stage 5 gives Defence 33 and Strength 35 on its own: Dragon Slayer I pays 18,650 XP in each. Quest points count the optional Shield of Arrav (S3-05) and, from stage 8, the optional A Porcine of Interest (a task of S8-04) in the top of the range. Attack 60 for the Dragon scimitar is not guaranteed by this route: Monkey Madness I pays 35,000 XP in the pair you choose (Daero's training), which is Attack 52 at most from here."
